  Persistent reasoning state for this agent session.

observation session-start
  Persistent reasoning state was initialized for this agent session.

claim current-goal
  Implement `partial_structure` on cattrs' `BaseConverter` plus top-level export, returning a new `PartialResult` type; work on a new branch from main and commit everything.

claim requirements
  - `PartialResult` fields: value (partial object or None), is_complete, structured_fields (frozenset of field names structured from input), failed_fields (frozenset), errors (Exception or None), error_map (dict field name -> Exception).
  - Fields absent from input count as failed, not structured.
  - Failed fields with defaults fall back to defaults; required fields without defaults force value=None.
  - Nested attrs/dataclass fields recurse: partially complete nested -> use its partial value AND mark parent field failed; no nested value possible -> normal field failure.
  - Collection fields (List, Dict) are atomic: element failure fails whole field.
  - `PartialResult.refine(data)` -> new PartialResult fixing failed fields with data, preserving structured fields.
  - init=False fields excluded from structured_fields and failed_fields.
  - forbid_extra_keys: extra keys => is_complete False but value still produced.
  - Respect detailed_validation (aggregate errors into ClassValidationError w/ notes when on; first raw error when off).
  - Support attrs classes, dataclasses, TypedDicts. Export PartialResult from cattrs.

claim progress
  - Branch `partial-structure` created from main (commit 6bc4708).
  - src/cattrs/partial.py created: frozen-slots Generic PartialResult with public fields value/is_complete/structured_fields/failed_fields/errors/error_map + private converter/cl/data; refine() merges data for non-structured keys, re-runs partial_structure; raises ValueError if no converter attached.
  - converters.py: imports added (NOTHING, adapted_fields, get_notrequired_base, error classes incl. AttributeValidationNote/ClassValidationError/ForbiddenExtraKeysError, typeddict helpers _adapted_fields/_required_keys aliased, PartialResult); BaseConverter.partial_structure implemented (Annotated strip, non-mapping input -> empty mapping + TypeError base_error, routing to typeddict/attrs/fallback paths); _partial_structure_fallback, _partial_structure_attrs, _partial_structure_typeddict methods added; module helpers _partially_structurable (plain non-generic attrs/dataclass/TypedDict only -> atomic otherwise) and _aggregate_errors (ClassValidationError when detailed else first error) added after _is_extended_factory.
  - Error formats match gen hooks: note "Structuring class {cl.__qualname__} @ attribute {name}"; aggregate "While structuring {cl.__name__}".

