claim uncertainty
  Design choices not pinned by spec (documented in code): error_map contains KeyError entries for absent fields; refine ignores new data for already-structured fields; generics/custom top-level hooks fall back to full-structure behavior. Confidence moderate-high. Not yet verified by running code.

